<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n51362" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">volva</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vulva</span></b> ,
			ae, f.
		volvo, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a wrapper</i>, <i>covering</i>, <i>integument.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b> In gen.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">fungorum,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					22, 22, 46, § 93</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pomorum,</span>”
				i. e. <i>the seed-covering</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Scrib. Comp. 104 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			 —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b> In
			partic., <i>the womb</i>, <i>matrix</i>
			of women and she-animals (syn. uterus), <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 2, 1, 19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Cels. 4, 1</span></i>; <i><span class="en">4, 20</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 21</span></i>; 5, 25 et saep.;
				<i><span class="en">Plin.
				11, 37, 84, § 209</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Juv. 6,
			128</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 11, 61, 11</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Pers. 4,
				35 al.</span></i>—<i>A sow's matrix</i>, as
			a very favorite dish, <i><span class="en">Plin. 11, 37, 84, § 210</span></i>;
			Naev. ap. <i><span class="en">Macr. S. 2, 14</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Hor. Ep. 1, 15, 41</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Mart. 13,
				56, 2</span></i>.</div>
